":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T15:57:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T16:19:38Z","body":"In step 4 does the destination data stream exist? I suspect that `metrics-fleet_server.agent_status-storedsource` gets treated as an index when calling `_reindex`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/2754931376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lkts","id":6067981,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNjc5ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6067981?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts","html_url":"https://github.com/lkts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/2755012796","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/125607#issuecomment-2755012796","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/125607","id":2755012796,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAe_f86kNii8","user":{"login":"lucabelluccini","id":87379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini","html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelluccini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelluccini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T16:24:37Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T16:25:20Z","body":"Hello @lkts \n\nAt step (4), the data stream doesn't exist, but I would expect to be created automatically (I have the rights and the index template would generate a data stream).\n\nBut ignoring this, you can see that at step (6) I create the destination data stream manually (7) and still the reindex fails (8).\n\nOnly adding the `routing_path` at Index Template level (9) makes it succeed.\n\nTo me, it is not normal that we have a different behavior if the `routing_path` is explicit or derived from the mappings. Once the index gets \"materialized\", `routing_path` is there, regardless from where it is generated/coming from.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/2755012796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lucabelluccini","id":87379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.g