i.github.com/users/lkts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T23:28:38Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T23:30:13Z","body":"This happens because reindexer tries to build settings before the index is created https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/9feac7833e7d91dae219de5517bb397995debe95/modules/reindex/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/reindex/Reindexer.java#L262\n\nThis crucially is different from https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/9feac7833e7d91dae219de5517bb397995debe95/server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/cluster/metadata/MetadataCreateIndexService.java#L1047 because the former does not take into account `IndexSettingProvider`s.\n\nIt's an issue with reindexing that is not specific to TSDS. TSDS just has a setting validation that triggers it. I am not sure if these two code paths can be unified so let's ask somebody who knows this.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/2784854258/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lkts","id":6067981,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNjc5ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6067981?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts","html_url":"https://github.com/lkts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription